{"step_index":865,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T18:28:19Z","content":"I have applied a comprehensive visual polish to elevate the entire user interface to a clean, high-tech industrial aesthetic:\n\n---\n\n### Key UI & Styling Upgrades Applied\n\n1. **Ambient Cyberpunk Grid & Glassmorphism**:\n   - Upgraded canvas background with subtle $32\\text{px}$ industrial laser gridlines and ambient triple-gradient glow (`#00f0ff` cyan, `#bf5af2` purple, `#05df9d` emerald).\n   - Upgraded card containers with frosted glass effect (`backdrop-filter: blur(20px)`), glowing cyan border insets, and smooth hover elevation transitions.\n\n2. **Custom Cyber Slim Scrollbars**:\n   - Replaced default browser scrollbars with custom slim, glowing cyan scroll tracks that match the dark futuristic theme.\n\n3. **High-Tech Typography & HUD Elements**:\n   - Clear visual hierarchy using `Orbitron` for major system headers, `Rajdhani` for telemetry labels, and `JetBrains Mono` for real-time numerical readings.\n   - Status indicators with live pulsating LED beacon animations (Green for `ONLINE`, Cyan for `GRAD-CAM ACTIVE`, Crimson for `DEFECT`).\n\n4. **Streamlined Navigation & Tab Badging**:\n   - Upgraded tab pills with illuminated border halos and high-contrast active states.\n   - Standardized evidence cards (`LOW`, `MEDIUM`, `HIGH`, `CRITICAL`) with colored neon left-accent borders.\n\n5. **Plotly Cyber Chart Harmonization**:\n   - All charts (donut, bar, waterfall, radar, gauges, response curves, parity plots) utilize unified transparent backgrounds with neon color tokens and clutter-free minimalist axes.\n\n---\n\n### Tips for Best Visual Presentation\n- **Run in Dark Mode / Full Screen**: Press `F11` in your browser for a full-screen mission control view.\n- **Collapse the Sidebar**: Clicking the arrow at the top-left of the sidebar hides controls and expands the analytical dashboard across the entire display."}
